content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Recycling": {
      "objects": [
        "Recycling Community Member",
        "Personal Recycling Data",
        "Drop-Off",
        "Recycling Center",
        "Drop-Off Site",
        "Zip Code",
        "Accepted Material Type",
        "Opening Hours",
        "User Visit Data",
        "Center Staff",
        "Center Equipment",
        "Community Recycling Events"
      ]
    },
    "Organization": {
      "objects": [
        "Recycling Facility Representative",
        "Administrator",
        "Join Request",
        "Center Feedback",
        "Drop-Off Suggestion"
      ]
    },
    "Statistics": {
      "objects": [
        "Company",
        "Recycling Data",
        "Researcher",
        "Company Partner"
      ]
    },
    "subdomain connections": [
      "Recycling--Organization",
      "Organization--Statistics"
    ]
  }
}
```
